                        "glosses": [
                            "A female given name transferred from the surname, popular in the 1980s and 1990s due to the fame of Whitney Houston."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "75abb87c-ba7b-4f2e-aec7-d01b92f244f3",
                                "sense_id": "34992b64-c49d-3333-971b-01051bff0a02",
                                "text": "\"I don't believe I've ever known a woman named 'Whitney',\" I said, trying not to look too deeply into her bright blue eyes. \"Or, hell, even a man for that matter.\"\n\"You've never heard of Whitney Houston?\"\n\"Who's that?\" I said, realizing that I had never gotten really serious about a woman with blue eyes."
                            },
