                                "sense_id": "34992b64-c49d-3333-971b-01051bff0a02",
                                "text": "“His research shows you can change aging to make lives younger for longer. Now he wants to change the world and make aging a disease,” said Whitney Casey, an investor who is partnering with Sinclair to create a do-it-yourself biological age test."
